# Harness tests

Use pytest. Workspaces are `tmp_path`. Patch limits with `monkeypatch` on `harnh3x.agent`.

Do not call the real API. Pass a `SimpleNamespace` client into `run`.

Assert message shape, `Error:` / `outside workspace` / `blocked` strings, truncation length, and the JSONL event order: `turn`, `model`, `tool_call`, `tool_result`, plus the closing `model` when turns run out.

```python
# BAD: constructing OpenAI() inside a test
client = OpenAI()

# GOOD: a fake client and an isolated workspace
client = SimpleNamespace(
    chat=SimpleNamespace(completions=SimpleNamespace(create=create))
)
text = agent.run("read missing.txt", session, client=client)
```
